==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Blanka (Enemy)|Blanka]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use the [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon]] variants, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut]] and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] to sort out Blanka and either [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross]] or tanky units like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] will be able to kill the peons and Master A.

